    "description": "Shown when a step's allow_only/disallow check refused something and the lesson author wrote no message. `construct` is already phrased: a Python keyword arrives as a markdown code span, anything else as one of the lessonScreen_construct* strings. Each locale writes those to fit its own sentence here — English carries the article on the phrase (\"an assignment\"), Dutch carries it on the sentence (\"geen {construct}\") — so they are not interchangeable between locales.",
